  "ruleText": "Stra 1106.03 Establishment of Procedures by the Participating Institution. Each participating postsecondary institution may establish its own procedures for awarding and distributing scholarships consistent with Stra 1100, RSA 4-C:31-33, and the provisions of the institution’s participation agreement.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
